{"lines": [{"text": "Your credit card has no battery.", "start": 0.3, "end": 2.075}, {"text": "So how does it pay with just a tap?", "start": 2.225, "end": 3.865}, {"text": "Hidden inside is a thin coil of wire, connected to a tiny chip.", "start": 4.265, "end": 8.393}, {"text": "The card reader is always putting out an invisible magnetic field.", "start": 8.743, "end": 12.846}, {"text": "Bring your card within about an inch and a half, and that field powers the chip.", "start": 13.146, "end": 17.292}, {"text": "For a split second, it wakes up and creates a code that only works once.", "start": 17.642, "end": 21.921}, {"text": "Steal that code, and it's useless for the next purchase.", "start": 22.271, "end": 25.302}, {"text": "Your phone does the same thing. But it never even sends your real card number.", "start": 25.652, "end": 30.107}], "total": 30.107, "words": [{"w": "Your", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.56, "line": 0}, {"w": "credit", "s": 0.56, "e": 0.915, "line": 0}, {"w": "card", "s": 0.915, "e": 1.176, "line": 0}, {"w": "has", "s": 1.176, "e": 1.389, "line": 0}, {"w": "no", "s": 1.389, "e": 1.554, "line": 0}, {"w": "battery.", "s": 1.554, "e": 2.075, "line": 0}, {"w": "So", "s": 2.225, "e": 2.37, "line": 1}, {"w": "how", "s": 2.37, "e": 2.557, "line": 1}, {"w": "does", "s": 2.557, "e": 2.786, "line": 1}, {"w": "it", "s": 2.786, "e": 2.931, "line": 1}, {"w": "pay", "s": 2.931, "e": 3.118, "line": 1}, {"w": "with", "s": 3.118, "e": 3.346, "line": 1}, {"w": "just", "s": 3.346, "e": 3.574, "line": 1}, {"w": "a", "s": 3.574, "e": 3.678, "line": 1}, {"w": "tap?", "s": 3.678, "e": 3.865, "line": 1}, {"w": "Hidden", "s": 4.265, "e": 4.686, "line": 2}, {"w": "inside", "s": 4.686, "e": 5.107, "line": 2}, {"w": "is", "s": 5.107, "e": 5.304, "line": 2}, {"w": "a", "s": 5.304, "e": 5.444, "line": 2}, {"w": "thin", "s": 5.444, "e": 5.753, "line": 2}, {"w": "coil", "s": 5.753, "e": 6.062, "line": 2}, {"w": "of", "s": 6.062, "e": 6.259, "line": 2}, {"w": "wire,", "s": 6.259, "e": 6.7